llowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T23:23:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T23:23:39Z","body":"For the icon, I suggest:\r\n\r\n- For path display, use the NodePath icon:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8e222ff-e647-4505-90bd-839235b99370)\r\n\r\n- For UID display, use a new icon that spells out \"uid\" using the same \"font\" we have for other text icons.\r\nI made one:\r\n\r\n![UID](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/124735ae-af85-44b8-bfde-b5ce39ec1ceb)\r\n\r\nThe color is random, I just picked the `v` from `Vector2.svg`, flipped it to make a `u`, and reused the color for the `id` from `RID.svg`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968424025/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2976734546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106716#issuecomment-2976734546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106716","id":2976734546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xbV1S","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T13:47:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T13:47:04Z","body":"\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0d56056-9f39-4a15-83e3-c53d66e69657\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2976734546/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980826274","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106716#issuecomment-2980826274","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106716","id":2980826274,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xq8yi","user":{"login":"geekley","id":38332912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzMyOTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38332912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley","html_url":"https://github.com/geekley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T15:26:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T15:32:29Z","body":"Cool. Does it work in Project Settings too? IIRC settings like main scene, environment, etc. are now uids...\r\nEditor Settings presumably don't have it?\r\n\r\nAlso, I dunno if it's the case now, but I suggest the toggle button be always there even if the value is empty, so you always know what will happen, and whether it's declared `@export_file` or `@export_file_path` even before you set it.\r\n\r\nIs the toggle global/sync or independent per-field? Is it a persisted editor setting? Small difference, and tbh I dunno which is nicer, just asking out of curiosity. I assume no persist, it always shows path initially and uid is only seen if/where you want, since you'd rarely need to worry about its actual value? If uid is on, can you still edit/input/paste the uid manually or is it readonly? Does it accept setting either uid or res regardless of the toggle (is it just for display)? If so, will the toggle automatically change if you paste uid on a res or vice-versa?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980826274/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981215388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106716#issuecomment-2981215388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106716","id":2981215388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xsbyc","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T17:32:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T17:32:48Z","body":"> Does it work in Project Settings too?\r\n\r\nI didn't test, but likely yes.\r\n\r\n> Editor Settings presumably don't have it?\r\n\r\nYes, UIDs only exist in projects.\r\n\r\n> I suggest the toggle button be always there even if the value is empty, so you always know what will happen\r\n\r\nI'm not sure about that. The button appears when the property refers some UID. When it's empty, it would just do nothing.\r\n\r\n> Is the toggle global/sync or independent per-field? Is it a persisted editor setting?\r\n\r\nIt's independent and non-persistent.\r\n\r\n> If uid is on, can you still edit/input/paste the uid manually or is it readonly?\r\n\r\nThe button only controls what is displayed. You can type both path and UID in either mode. If you enable UID and paste a path, it will be changed to UID. If you disable UID and paste UID, it will be changed to path.","author_associati